{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the existing plugin dispatch-order contract.** `PluginRunner` previously documented and implemented registration-order dispatch for every hook. Reversing `onInvocationEnd` changes observable behavior for existing multi-plugin configurations and can invert established flush or cleanup dependencies. Retain registration order, or introduce an explicit opt-in LIFO scope mechanism.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77SFWt","finding_digest":"228b02e451d041f1350baeb06c1087e868a78673c95bfbe462221502988bf67c","finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"e874605b3ffb4e4d93f9d9e1fc789007fda77ba48b17ebd34f49c794f443e10c","observation_id":"aro_v1_5b2gawz77nhe3e7z3hq7y6eqa7","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","published_at":"2026-10-08T06:50:37Z","review_id":"arr_v1_oku3igfk3ygjtbpxj7vr4crtuk","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"2df3d686638d1451d0c62cd2678c16968f3482f4","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_okymysnfj4rue2w67it3wkh3q3","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T06:50:37Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
